* Stellar Classic assets
** Model
*** CODE:ISSUER identity
*** Trustline per holder
*** Issuer cannot hold its own asset
*** int64, 7 decimals
** Issuer controls
*** AUTH_REQUIRED
*** AUTH_REVOCABLE (freeze)
*** AUTH_CLAWBACK_ENABLED
*** AUTH_IMMUTABLE
*** Lock issuer to cap supply
** Built-in features
*** SDEX order book and AMM
*** Path payments
*** Claimable balances
*** Sponsored reserves
** Mapping to Ethereum
*** ERC-20: no allowance on Classic
*** ERC-7943: no partial freeze
*** forcedTransfer = clawback + mint
** Next steps
*** SEP-8 approval server
*** SAC with contract admin
*** SEP-41 custom token
**** OpenZeppelin RWA module
